    "summary": "During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) you may activate Psychic Veil with a D6 roll. A result of 1 inflicts D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on the psyker’s unit. A result of **2+** protects the unit from ranged attacks made farther than **18″** away until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins.",
